title: GELF criteria
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* ≥3 involved nodal sites, each ≥3 cm in diameter.
* Any nodal or extranodal mass ≥7 cm in diameter.
* B symptoms.
* Splenomegaly.
* Pleural effusion or peritoneal ascites.
* Leukocytes <1.0 × 10^9^/L and/or platelets <100 × 10^9^/L.
* Circulating malignant cells >5.0 × 10^9^/L.

Sources: NCCN B-Cell Lymphomas v4.2026, FOLL-A (supplied PDF, p. 21).
